   1992},
Abstract = {A new visual colorimeter for quantifying perception of color and
   brightness of natural objects seen through the atmosphere is described.
   The instrument is basically a small video monitor controlled by a
   portable computer. The advantages of a video system over conventional
   visual colorimeters are discussed. Experimental results show that under
   controlled laboratory conditions the precision of the color matches is
   about 4\% and the accuracy is about 5\%.},
