   AUG 31-SEP 03, 2014},
Abstract = {Growing importance of health information platforms are acknowledges in
   recent studies. Such platforms are subject to discussion about an extent
   to which social network characteristics are realized. The platform under
   examination indeed demonstrates social network peculiarities. In this
   work, we explore the nature of centrality in one of the leading health
   information networks in Europe. Among other findings, we identify two
   nodes (representing patient and physician) are as the most important
   people in the network in terms of structural analysis Egregiously, these
   nodes are connected with the other types only and exhibit worth noticing
   connection patterns. These connections have been discussed along with a
   medication advice seeking behavior.},
